==Strategy==
This stage can be rushed with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Use [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to clear out the early peons, and play Bahamut as soon as you can. Meatshield consistently with [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]]. [[Cat Combo]]s can help, especially Starting Money UP or [[Critical Hit|Critical]] Chance UP ([[Miracle Performance (Combo)|Miracle Performance]] is accessible and effective).

